@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "US-01: View Room Availability" as UC_View
  usecase "US-02: Book Study Room" as UC_Book
  usecase "US-03: Cancel Booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "US-04: Generate Booking Confirmation" as UC_Confirm
  usecase "US-05a: Block Room" as UC_Block
  usecase "US-05b: Unblock Room" as UC_Unblock
  usecase "US-06: Review Room Usage" as UC_Review
}

' Student primary associations
student --> UC_View
student --> UC_Book
student --> UC_Cancel

' Administrator primary associations
admin --> UC_Block
admin --> UC_Unblock
admin --> UC_Review

' Include relationship justification:
' Rule R4 & US-04: Every successful execution of "Book Study Room" unconditionally
' generates and issues a confirmation record.
UC_Book .> UC_Confirm : <<include>>

note right of UC_Book
  **Rules enforced:**
  - R1: Future start, duration in (0, 2h]
  - R2: No active overlapping booking
  - R3: Room must not be blocked
end note

note bottom of UC_Block
  **Assumptions:**
  - Touching bookings (e.g. 11:00-12:00 and 12:00-13:00) do not overlap.
  - Blocking prevents only new bookings; existing bookings persist.
  - Students cancel only bookings they own.
end note
@enduml